{"amendments":[],"id":"raspberry-pi-enclosure-01-basis","requirements":[{"id":"PI01-SOURCE","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/raspberry-pi-enclosure/01-riverstone-desktop-computer/prompt.txt","locator":"research request","sha256":"a0990078b18f5430118ded029e435326a48ad841f598552cd36ddaf0be3b52f5"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/raspberry-pi-enclosure/01-riverstone-desktop-computer/context.md","locator":"Product research and intended user","sha256":"1386aa7f548e89ca86f5ec85d3b6476d10e8e3e841e2e691879c49dcc8bb3ee5"}],"text":"Board outline, holes, connectors, plug access and cooling envelope come from a pinned official Raspberry Pi 5 source with URL/revision/retrieval evidence; absent dimensions remain unresolved and the sketch is not authority."},{"id":"PI01-ENCLOSURE","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/raspberry-pi-enclosure/01-riverstone-desktop-computer/context.md","locator":"Envelope and construction","sha256":"1386aa7f548e89ca86f5ec85d3b6476d10e8e3e841e2e691879c49dcc8bb3ee5"}],"text":"Both variants fit 112×86×39 mm, use a two-part 2.4 mm-wall shell with 2 mm inside radii, four underside fasteners, 5 mm feet lift, no visible top screws and 8 mm connector insertion clearance."},{"id":"PI01-THERMAL","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/raspberry-pi-enclosure/01-riverstone-desktop-computer/context.md","locator":"Thermal case","sha256":"1386aa7f548e89ca86f5ec85d3b6476d10e8e3e841e2e691879c49dcc8bb3ee5"}],"text":"Matched domains use 25 °C ambient, 6 W on the declared 18×18 mm patch, shell k=0.20 W/(m·K), identical board/feet/material/domain, and explicit air, gravity, radiation and boundary assumptions."},{"id":"PI01-VENT-A","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/raspberry-pi-enclosure/01-riverstone-desktop-computer/context.md","locator":"Thermal case","sha256":"1386aa7f548e89ca86f5ec85d3b6476d10e8e3e841e2e691879c49dcc8bb3ee5"}],"text":"Variant A has lower side inlet/rear exhaust with at least 450 mm² nominal opening."},{"id":"PI01-VENT-B","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/raspberry-pi-enclosure/01-riverstone-desktop-computer/context.md","locator":"Thermal case","sha256":"1386aa7f548e89ca86f5ec85d3b6476d10e8e3e841e2e691879c49dcc8bb3ee5"}],"text":"Variant B retains the same inlet and has twelve rounded nominal 2×20 mm top slots."},{"id":"PI01-CFD","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/raspberry-pi-enclosure/01-riverstone-desktop-computer/context.md","locator":"Thermal case","sha256":"1386aa7f548e89ca86f5ec85d3b6476d10e8e3e841e2e691879c49dcc8bb3ee5"}],"text":"Actual fields, convergence, heat balance and airflow summaries support a comparable alternative assessment against the below-65 °C source-patch goal."},{"id":"PI01-DELIVERABLES","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/raspberry-pi-enclosure/01-riverstone-desktop-computer/prompt.txt","locator":"requested outputs","sha256":"a0990078b18f5430118ded029e435326a48ad841f598552cd36ddaf0be3b52f5"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/raspberry-pi-enclosure/01-riverstone-desktop-computer/context.md","locator":"Business rules and review","sha256":"1386aa7f548e89ca86f5ec85d3b6476d10e8e3e841e2e691879c49dcc8bb3ee5"}],"text":"The output set contains reviewed sourced design basis, both editable/STEP enclosures, matching fluid-domain STEP files and machine-readable CFD comparison."},{"id":"PI01-SCOPE","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/raspberry-pi-enclosure/01-riverstone-desktop-computer/context.md","locator":"Business rules and review","sha256":"1386aa7f548e89ca86f5ec85d3b6476d10e8e3e841e2e691879c49dcc8bb3ee5"}],"text":"The result does not claim physical thermal accuracy, plastic performance, EMC, electrical safety, sealing or certification and performs no publication, purchase or manufacture."}],"unresolved_decisions":[],"version":"1"}
